# C++ formatting — the clang-format analogue of `ruff format` (AGENTS.md §Code style).
# Google base with the project's 4-space indent and 99-column limit (matching the Python
# ruff line-length). Mirrors crysta's config (ADR-0004 shared discipline).
BasedOnStyle: Google
IndentWidth: 4
ColumnLimit: 99
DerivePointerAlignment: false
PointerAlignment: Left
